<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish new car licensings rise to 14,691 in January.</title>
<headline>Irish new car licensings rise to 14,691 in January.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of new private cars licensed in Ireland rise to 14,691 in January 1997 from 1,946 in December 1996, provisional Central Statistics Office (CSO) data showed on Friday.</p>
<p>Licensings were up from January 1996 when they totalled 12,773.</p>
<p>--Dublin newsroom 353-1-6761-3377</p>
</text>
